  "contentHtml": "<p>한랭전선, 온난전선, 온대저기압 수업할때마다 전선의 움직임을 표현하고 싶은데 그림으로 그리니 자꾸 겹쳐져서 애들이 이해하기가 어렵더라구요. 그래서 만들어보았습니다.</p><p>전선은 스테플러로 연결, 뒤에는 자석을 붙혔습니다.</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b3be48da291b15ad0322df69a1f6099e7e702d96\" data-origin-width=\"1334\" data-origin-height=\"750\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b3be48da291b15ad0322df69a1f6099e7e702d96\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7c6de93339a008ccde08e713accff652627c99f3\" data-origin-width=\"1334\" data-origin-height=\"750\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7c6de93339a008ccde08e713accff652627c99f3\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7e8a32417bb1f11257df2aa538f6866007357b6f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"345\" height=\"259\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7e8a32417bb1f11257df2aa538f6866007357b6f\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
